  ae-train        Train/evaluate the episode-split FPV RGB Autoencoder baseline
  isaac-city-smoke  Validate the fixed-height city reset/step environment
  isaac-bc-collect  Collect synchronized clean RGB/state/A* demonstrations
  latent-prepare    Encode demonstrations and calculate train-only normalization
